                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is actually quite a good little gem that's a throwback to classic top down stealth shooter games! I was pleasantly surprised.\n\n\nPros: \nSolid gameplay\nGreat graphics\nGreat characters\nEasy to follow story\nSmooth animations. I LOVE the knife kills. So satisfying.\n\nCons:\nA few bugs. None distract from the experience.\n\nOverall worth the price! 9/10",
